Parameters:  
- smtp_server (string): Hostname or IP of the SMTP server (e.g., "smtp.gmail.com").  
- port (integer): Port number to connect to on the SMTP server (e.g., 587).  
- use_tls (boolean): Whether to secure the connection with STARTTLS (true/false).  
- username (string): Username or login ID for the SMTP server.  
- password (string): Password or app‐specific token for authentication.  
- from_address (string): The “From” email address (e.g., "sender@example.com").  
- to_addresses (list of strings): One or more recipient email addresses.  
- cc_addresses (optional, list of strings): One or more CC recipient addresses.  
- bcc_addresses (optional, list of strings): One or more BCC recipient addresses.  
- subject (string): Subject line of the email.  
- html_body (string): The HTML content to include in the body of the email.  
- attachments (optional, list of file paths or file‐objects): Files to attach to the email.  

